13
00:00:55.747 --> 00:01:02.140
The seminar will also review various
curricular options and program requirements

14
00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:04.465
for CS undergraduate students.

15
00:01:04.465 --> 00:01:11.100
Consider this worked case: A first-year
student cannot enroll until they have

16
00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:14.418
completed their introductory computer science
courses.

17
00:01:14.418 --> 00:01:20.812
Separate the formal definition from an
implementation detail, then identify what

18
00:01:20.812 --> 00:01:23.137
